@startuml BuildFlow_Collaboration_Diagram
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Architect (Sophia)" as Arch
rectangle "Frontend App (React)" as UI
rectangle "Backend Controller" as Backend
rectangle "Database (Prisma/SQLite)" as DB
rectangle "Engineer (Marcus PE)" as Eng
rectangle "Contractor (David)" as Cont

Arch -right-> UI : 1: uploadDesign(CAD_v2.1)
UI -right-> Backend : 2: POST /api/designs
Backend -down-> DB : 3: insertDesignRecord()
Backend -down-> DB : 4: createNotification()

Eng -left-> UI : 5: openReviewModal()
UI -down-> Backend : 6: POST /api/designs/:id/review
Backend -down-> DB : 7: updateStatus('APPROVED')
Backend -down-> DB : 8: logActivityAudit()

Backend -right-> UI : 9: notifyApproval()
UI -right-> Cont : 10: startTaskExecution()
@enduml
